{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A contraction hierarchy over the graph with these weights, for repeated shortest-path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries between arbitrary pairs of vertices."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/contractionHierarchy(witnessLimit:weight:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contractionHierarchy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"witnessLimit","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 500, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths20ContractionHierarchyV","text":"ContractionHierarchy","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/ContractionHierarchy"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","text":"AdditiveArithmetic","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","text":"Comparable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices a witness search may settle before giving up on ruling a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shortcut out. A budget too small for the graph’s structure lets shortcuts pile up, each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contraction then costing more than the last; the default suits road-like and grid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graphs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"witnessLimit"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The length of the edge at a position.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"weight"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Building it contracts every vertex, each contraction adding the shortcuts that keep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distances among the vertices still to come; a shortcut is ruled out by an arc that already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"joins its endpoints at its weight or less, or by a witness search that settles at most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"witnessLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" vertices, so a smaller limit builds faster and adds more shortcuts. Parallel","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edges count by their cheapest; self-loops are ignored. ","type":"text"},{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is called once per edge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the weights are kept.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n log n + m) plus the witness searches, O(witnessLimit · log n) for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pair of arcs through a contracted vertex; the shortcuts are O(n²) in the worst case and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a small multiple of m on road-like graphs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every weight is at least "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".zero"},{"type":"text","text":" and not NaN; every sum fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"W"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"witnessLimit"},{"type":"text","text":" is at least zero."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/contractionhierarchy(witnesslimit:weight:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"contractionHierarchy(witnessLimit:weight:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contractionHierarchy"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"witnessLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13ShortestPaths20ContractionHierarchyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ContractionHierarc